{
  "_comment": [
    "REFERENCE ONLY — not the source of truth.",
    "The task definition that is actually deployed is generated by",
    "aws/cloudformation/ecs-service.yml. This file documents the equivalent",
    "shape for ad-hoc `aws ecs register-task-definition` use and for the",
    "companion UI projects to model theirs on. Placeholders in {BRACES} must be",
    "substituted before use.",
    "Key alignment points with the architecture (aws/docs/aws-architecture.mmd):",
    "  - portMappings entry is NAMED so ECS Service Connect can publish it.",
    "  - Only two Secrets Manager entries exist: grouper-password and jwt-secret.",
    "    Grouper URL/login are NON-secret and belong in environment[].",
    "  - No healthCheck: the health endpoint depends on on-prem Grouper WS,",
    "    reached via the NAT Gateway, pending the UH firewall allow-list.",
    "  - SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE is aws-<APP_TIER>, i.e. aws-test or aws-prod."
  ],
  "family": "{AWS_OWNER}-{AWS_PROJECT_ID}-{AWS_ENV}",
  "networkMode": "awsvpc",
  "requiresCompatibilities": ["FARGATE"],
  "cpu": "512",
  "memory": "1024",
  "executionRoleArn": "arn:aws:iam::{AWS_ACCOUNT_ID}:role/{AWS_OWNER}-{AWS_PROJECT_ID}-{AWS_ENV}-role-ecs-execution",
  "taskRoleArn": "arn:aws:iam::{AWS_ACCOUNT_ID}:role/{AWS_OWNER}-{AWS_PROJECT_ID}-{AWS_ENV}-role-ecs-task",
  "containerDefinitions": [
    {
      "name": "{AWS_OWNER}-{AWS_PROJECT_ID}-{AWS_ENV}",
      "image": "{AWS_ACCOUNT_ID}.dkr.ecr.{AWS_REGION}.amazonaws.com/{AWS_OWNER}-{AWS_PROJECT_ID}-{AWS_ENV}:latest",
      "essential": true,
      "portMappings": [
        {
          "name": "api-8080",
          "containerPort": 8080,
          "protocol": "tcp",
          "appProtocol": "http"
        }
      ],
      "environment": [
        {
          "name": "SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE",
          "value": "aws-test"
        },
        {
          "name": "AWS_REGION",
          "value": "{AWS_REGION}"
        },
        {
          "name": "SERVER_PORT",
          "value": "8080"
        },
        {
          "name": "JAVA_OPTS",
          "value": "-XX:+UseContainerSupport -XX:MaxRAMPercentage=75.0"
        }
      ],
      "secrets": [
        {
          "name": "GROUPERCLIENT_WEBSERVICE_PASSWORD",
          "valueFrom": "arn:aws:secretsmanager:{AWS_REGION}:{AWS_ACCOUNT_ID}:secret:groupings/api/grouper-password"
        },
        {
          "name": "JWT_SECRET_KEY",
          "valueFrom": "arn:aws:secretsmanager:{AWS_REGION}:{AWS_ACCOUNT_ID}:secret:groupings/api/jwt-secret"
        }
      ],
      "logConfiguration": {
        "logDriver": "awslogs",
        "options": {
          "awslogs-group": "/ecs/{AWS_OWNER}-{AWS_PROJECT_ID}-{AWS_ENV}",
          "awslogs-region": "{AWS_REGION}",
          "awslogs-stream-prefix": "ecs"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
